From: Prarit Bhargava <prarit@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 19:50:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] deps: include <climits> in V8 memcopy.h for aarch64

CHAR_BIT is used in SimdMemCopy on ARM64/NEON but memcopy.h only
included <arm_neon.h>. With GCC 16, CHAR_BIT is no longer available
transitively, so aarch64 builds fail.

Add #include <climits> inside the V8_OPTIMIZE_WITH_NEON block.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Signed-off-by: Prarit Bhargava <prarit@redhat.com>
---
 deps/v8/src/base/memcopy.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/deps/v8/src/base/memcopy.h b/deps/v8/src/base/memcopy.h
index b1d8a36b4cfe..3721a0d65df9 100644
--- a/deps/v8/src/base/memcopy.h
+++ b/deps/v8/src/base/memcopy.h
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
     (defined(__ARM_NEON) || defined(__ARM_NEON__))
 #define V8_OPTIMIZE_WITH_NEON
 #include <arm_neon.h>
+#include <climits>
 #endif
 namespace v8::base {
 
-- 
2.55.0

